// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apocky-PRIME-DIRECTIVE-v3
//
// § engine/frame_graph.cssl  —  W-5 phase-named frame graph
//
// CSSLv3 engine module · pure CSSL · stage-0 scaffold.
// Spec : specs/16_TRANSPORT_TIERS.csl § P2 BUILD → UPLOAD → RECORD
//        specs/16_TRANSPORT_TIERS.csl § P7 MEASURE-FIRST
//        specs/08_ENGINE.csl § CmdBuf · Buffer · render primitives
//
// Wave : W-5 PHASE-NAMED FRAME-GRAPH  (Apocky-mandate 2026-05-20 · autopilot)
//
// § ROLE
//   Names the render loop phases as first-class functions:
//     frame_build  → frame_upload → frame_record → frame_submit
//   This is the transcript's most important performance epistemology:
//   profile build/upload/record separately, then move work to the tier
//   that parallelizes it. Without named phases, every perf conclusion is
//   guesswork.
//
// § TARGET
//   1440p fullscreen · 144 Hz · 1_000_000 entities · pure CSSL.
//   CPU budget : ≤ 1_000 µs / frame across all four phases.
//
// § PRIME_DIRECTIVE preserved
//   Frame graph is local render orchestration. No surveillance. No override.

